---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout scripts="calculator" bodyClass="calculator-page" mainClass="section calculator-section" title="Lead Cost Calculator | Clean Rows" description="Estimate the cost of Clean Rows prospect lists for your monthly volume, compared with illustrative per-seat platform assumptions.">
<a class="text-link calculator-back" href="/">← Back to Clean Rows</a><h1>Lead cost calculator</h1><p>Explore estimated costs for your next campaign. Adjust the volume and team size to see the comparison.</p><div class="calculator" id="calculator"><div class="calculator-input"><p class="eyebrow"><span>↳</span>DO THE MATHS</p><h3>Plan your next prospect list</h3><p>Choose your monthly prospect volume and team size. Clean Rows pricing is per list, whether you use it for LinkedIn prospecting, email or account-based campaigns.</p><label for="volume">Leads per month <output id="volume-label">10,000</output></label><input id="volume" type="range" min="0" max="11" value="3"><div class="volume-presets"><button data-volume="10000" aria-pressed="true">10K</button><button data-volume="50000" aria-pressed="false">50K</button><button data-volume="100000" aria-pressed="false">100K</button><button data-volume="200000" aria-pressed="false">200K</button></div><label class="seat-label" for="seats">People who need access <input id="seats" type="number" min="1" max="100" value="3"></label></div><div class="calculator-result"><div class="calc-result-top"><span>ILLUSTRATIVE ESTIMATE</span><div role="group" aria-label="Estimate period"><button data-period="month" aria-pressed="true">Monthly</button><button data-period="year" aria-pressed="false">Yearly</button></div></div><div class="cost-row us"><span>Clean Rows</span><strong id="cost-us">$199</strong><i id="bar-us"></i></div><div class="cost-row"><span>Apollo.io</span><strong id="cost-apollo">$1,490</strong><i id="bar-apollo"></i></div><div class="cost-row"><span>ZoomInfo</span><strong id="cost-zoom">$2,708.33</strong><i id="bar-zoom"></i></div><div class="savings" aria-live="polite"><span id="savings-label">Illustrative difference against the lower comparison estimate</span><strong id="savings">$15,492</strong><span id="savings-period">per year</span></div><p class="micro" id="pricing-estimate-note">USD. Based on published packages. No annual discount is assumed.</p><a class="text-link" id="custom-quote-link" href="/#pricing" hidden>Request a custom quote ↗︎</a></div></div><details class="assumptions"><summary>See comparison assumptions</summary><p>Clean Rows estimates use the lowest total of published packages that covers your selected volume: $25 for 1,000, $199 for 10,000 and $799 for 50,000 leads. Package rounding can include extra records. Volumes of 100,000 or more require a custom quote, so no Clean Rows cost or savings figure is shown. Yearly estimates assume 12 identical monthly orders, with no annual discount or subscription. Final scope and delivery are confirmed before payment.</p><p>The comparison models use illustrative assumptions, not current provider quotes: $149 per seat per month and 1,000 monthly exports per seat for Apollo.io; $15,000 annually plus $2,500 per additional seat beyond three for ZoomInfo. The model uses your team size or estimated export-seat requirement, whichever is greater, and caps the export-seat estimate at 20. These products have different features and allowances. Compare your actual provider quotes before making a purchase.</p></details><div class="calculator-next"><p>Want to check the data before choosing a volume?</p><a class="button lime" href="/#contact">Get 100 free leads <span aria-hidden="true">↗︎</span></a></div></BaseLayout>
